<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] once considered a great Hero of Obsidia but after some events it became forgotten and abandoned by its own people. Has excellent combat skills and the ability to maintain own reputation. -->
  <OE_Eidolon.description>[PAWN_nameDef]曾被认为是黑曜石的伟大英雄，但在一些事件之后被自己的人民遗忘和抛弃。拥有出色的战斗技能和维持自己声誉的能力。</OE_Eidolon.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia empire eidolon -->
  <OE_Eidolon.title>黑曜石帝国幻影</OE_Eidolon.title>
  <!-- EN: eidolon -->
  <OE_Eidolon.titleShort>幻影</OE_Eidolon.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] once shaped synthetic souls and psionic engines in secret halls of the Empire. Some called it brilliance, others-blasphemy. -->
  <OE_Soulforger.description>[PAWN_nameDef]曾在帝国的秘密殿堂中塑造合成灵魂和灵能力引擎。有人称之为才华，有人称之为亵渎。</OE_Soulforger.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia empire soulforger -->
  <OE_Soulforger.title>黑曜石帝国灵魂锻造师</OE_Soulforger.title>
  <!-- EN: soulforger -->
  <OE_Soulforger.titleShort>灵魂锻造师</OE_Soulforger.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] once served as a strategic mastermind of the Obsidia command corps. After a failed campaign, vanished from records-yet still fights with clarity and resolve. -->
  <OE_Tactician.description>[PAWN_nameDef]曾担任黑曜石司令部的战略大师。在一次失败的战役后，从记录中消失——但仍以清晰和坚定的决心战斗。</OE_Tactician.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia empire tactician -->
  <OE_Tactician.title>黑曜石帝国战术家</OE_Tactician.title>
  <!-- EN: tactician -->
  <OE_Tactician.titleShort>战术家</OE_Tactician.titleShort>
  
</LanguageData>